      "slug": "approval",
      "kind": "states",
      "why": "An ask becomes an approval record with nine real states, and a call runs at most once, which only a state machine shows.",
      "label": "The life of an approval. It starts pending. A person approves or denies it, or it expires or is cancelled. An approved call runs once: executing ends executed, failed, or outcome_unknown when no answer came back.",
